    "notes": [
      "delivery + generation = totalBundled (±0.00001) — utility-agnostic field names (schema v3.0).",
      "Rates sourced from SCE_Combined_Rates.xlsx, validated against SCE tariff schedules and 3CE/CPA rate sheets.",
      "CCA combined rate = delivery + ccaGeneration[provider].tiers[tier][season][period].",
      "TOU-D-4-9PM winter has 3 periods (midPeak, offPeak, superOffPeak). Summer has 2 (peak, offPeak).",
      "TOU-D-PRIME summer: peak differs from off-peak/superOffPeak. Weekday peak used as canonical rate.",
      "CPA generation rates are real TOU-differentiated rates per CPA rate schedule (effective Mar 2025).",
      "3CE SCE-territory rates sourced from Residential-SCE-Website-Rate-Sheet-v2-2025.04.01.pdf.",
      "SBCE rates sourced from SCE-SBCE Joint Rate Comparisons (sce.com). SBCE uses flat generation rates (not TOU-differentiated). Green Start ~50% renewable, 100% Green = 100% renewable. Effective Mar 15 2026.",
      "TOU-D-4-9PM includes a baseline credit of -$0.10108/kWh on off-peak usage up to monthly baseline allowance. Rates shown are pre-credit (gross).",
      "TOU-D-PRIME has NO baseline credit.",
      "FRC ($0.00619/kWh) + MCAM ($0.00223/kWh) = $0.00842/kWh flat adder applies to all plans but is NOT embedded in rates. Noted for transparency.",
      "BSC is $0.794/meter/day for all SCE residential customers (not income-tiered like PG&E).",
      "Base tariff references: TOU-D variants = Advice 5338-E; Schedule D = Advice 5654-E."
    ]
